--- !u!114 &1770763759
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1770763757}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<voffset=0.4em><b><size=0em>\u3000</size></b></voffset>\r\n- Navigation\r\n 
    - <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C padding=\"25,25,0,0\">rightclick+drag\u2194</mark><space=0.2em>
    to pan\r\n    - hold <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C padding=\"25,25,0,0\">Alt</mark><space=0.2em>
    to pan quickly!\r\n  - <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C padding=\"25,25,0,0\">shift+rightclick+drag\u2195</mark><space=0.2em>
    to zoom\r\n  - <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C padding=\"25,25,0,0\">Home</mark><space=0.2em>/<space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C
    padding=\"25,25,0,0\">End</mark><space=0.2em> to go to the start/end of your
    chart\r\n- Playtesting\r\n  - <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C padding=\"25,25,0,0\">Spacebar</mark><space=0.2em>
    to start playtest from your mouse pointer position in autoplay\r\n  - <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C
    padding=\"25,25,0,0\">Shift+Spacebar</mark><space=0.2em> to start playtest in
    manual play\r\n  - While in playtest, press <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C padding=\"25,25,0,0\">Escape</mark><space=0.2em>
    to exit\r\n- Click somewhere in empty space to put your cursor there\r\n  - <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C
    padding=\"25,25,0,0\">Tab</mark><space=0.2em>/<space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C padding=\"25,25,0,0\">N</mark><space=0.2em>
    to make a new word (or <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C padding=\"25,25,0,0\">Ctrl+Shift+click</mark><space=0.2em>ing
    in empty space also works)\r\n  - <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C padding=\"25,25,0,0\">Ctrl+V</mark><space=0.2em>
    to paste (in case)\r\n- Click a word to select it\r\n  - <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C
    padding=\"25,25,0,0\">Ctrl+C</mark><space=0.2em> to copy\r\n  - <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C
    padding=\"25,25,0,0\">F2</mark><space=0.2em>/<space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C padding=\"25,25,0,0\">R</mark><space=0.2em>
    to edit the word (or <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C padding=\"25,25,0,0\">Alt+click</mark><space=0.2em>ing
    it also works) => <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C padding=\"25,25,0,0\">Enter</mark><space=0.2em>/<space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C
    padding=\"25,25,0,0\">Escape</mark><space=0.2em> to submit\r\n  - <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C
    padding=\"25,25,0,0\">Del</mark><space=0.2em> to delete the word (or removing
    all letters and submitting also works)\r\n- Dragging on a word\r\n  - Normally
    drag on a word to move it\r\n    - Move by \xBCth beats by holding <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C
    padding=\"25,25,0,0\">Shift</mark><space=0.2em> and move smoothly (1/100th beats)
    by holding <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C padding=\"25,25,0,0\">Shift+Alt</mark><space=0.2em>.
    (This also goes for moving the cursor)\r\n  - Drag with right mouse button to
    change its beat spacing\r\n    - This switches between these amounts of beats:
    <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C padding=\"25,25,0,0\">{.125, 1/6, .25, 1/3, .5,
    1, 2, 4}</mark><space=0.2em>\r\n- Special stuff when editing words:\r\n  - _Chord_:
    start the word with <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C padding=\"25,25,0,0\">[[</mark><space=0.2em>\r\n 
    - _Randomly generated English word of length_: make a word consisting entirely
    of the letter <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C padding=\"25,25,0,0\">x</mark><space=0.2em>\r\n 
    - A word can have spaces -- these will just count as beats where you don't have
    to input anything in gameplay\r\n  - Use <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C padding=\"25,25,0,0\">Shift+Space</mark><space=0.2em>
    to type the <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C padding=\"25,25,0,0\">\u23B5</mark><space=0.2em>
    character -- this counts as a <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C padding=\"25,25,0,0\">Spacebar</mark><space=0.2em>
    character to input in gameplay\r\n- <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C padding=\"25,25,0,0\">Ctrl+Z</mark><space=0.2em>/<space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C
    padding=\"25,25,0,0\">Ctrl+Y</mark><space=0.2em> to undo/redo\r\n- <space=0.2em><mark=#FFFFFF3C
    padding=\"25,25,0,0\">Ctrl+S</mark><space=0.2em> to save\r\n<voffset=0.4em><b><size=0em>\u3000</size></b></voffset>\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56b16e7b90b1f264a9120a6f1d93c229, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -2087597299237238584, guid: 56b16e7b90b1f264a9120a6f1d93c229,
    type: 2}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
  m_fontMaterial: {fileID: 0}
  m_fontMaterials: []
